{"url": "https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/1879001/000164117225017140/formnt10-k.htm", "fetched_at": "2026-09-22T20:38:27.454734+00:00", "body": "<DOCUMENT>\n<TYPE>NT 10-K\n<SEQUENCE>1\n<FILENAME>formnt10-k.htm\n<DESCRIPTION>NT 10-K\n<TEXT>\n<HTML>\n<HEAD>\n     <TITLE></TITLE>\n</HEAD>\n<BODY STYLE=\"font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif\">\n\n<P STYLE=\"text-align: center; font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt\"><FONT STYLE=\"font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt\">&nbsp;</FONT></P>\n\n<P STYLE=\"font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; margin-left: 0; text-align: center\"><FONT STYLE=\"font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt\"></FONT></P>\n\n<!-- Field: Rule-Page --><DIV STYLE=\"margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; width: 100%\"><DIV STYLE=\"font-size: 1pt; border-top: Black 4pt solid; border-bottom: Black 1.5pt solid\">&nbsp;</DIV></DIV><!-- Field: /Rule-Page -->\n\n<P STYLE=\"font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; margin-left: 0; text-align: center\"><FONT STYLE=\"font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt\"><B>&nbsp;</B></FONT></P>\n\n<P STYLE=\"font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; margin-left: 0; text-align: center\"><FONT STYLE=\"font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt\"><B></B></FONT></P>\n\n<TABLE CELLSPACING=\"0\" CELLPADDING=\"0\" STYLE=\"font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; width: 100%; border-collapse: collapse\">\n  <TR STYLE=\"vertical-align: top\">\n    <TD STYLE=\"width: 20%; padding-right: 5.4pt; padding-left: 5.4pt\">&nbsp;</TD>\n    <TD STYLE=\"width: 60%; padding-right: 5.4pt; padding-left: 5.4pt; text-align: center\"><FONT STYLE=\"font-size: 18pt\"><B>UNITED STATES</B></FONT></TD>\n    <TD STYLE=\"width: 20%; padding-right: 5.4pt; padding-left: 5.4pt; text-align: center\"></TD></TR>\n  <TR STYLE=\"vertical-align: top\">\n    <TD STYLE=\"padding-right: 5.4pt; padding-left: 5.4pt\">&nbsp;</TD>\n    <TD STYLE=\"padding-right: 5.4pt; padding-left: 5.4pt; text-align: center\"><FONT STYLE=\"font-size: 18pt\"><B>SECURITIES AND EXCHANGE\n    COMMISSION</B></FONT></TD>\n    <TD STYLE=\"border-top: Black 1pt solid; vertical-align: top; border-right: Black 1pt solid; border-left: Black 1pt solid; padding-right: 5.4pt; padding-left: 5.4pt; text-align: center\"><P STYLE=\"margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 0\"><FONT STYLE=\"font-size: 10pt\"><FONT STYLE=\"font-size: 10pt\">SEC FILE NUMBER</FONT></FONT></P>\n                                                                              <P STYLE=\"margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 0\"><FONT STYLE=\"font-size: 10pt\">000-56692</FONT></P></TD></TR>\n  <TR STYLE=\"vertical-align: top\">\n    <TD STYLE=\"padding-right: 5.4pt; padding-left: 5.4pt\">&nbsp;</TD>\n    <TD STYLE=\"padding-right: 5.4pt; padding-left: 5.4pt; text-align: center\"><FONT STYLE=\"font-size: 12pt\"><B>Washington, D.C. 20549</B></FONT></TD>\n    <TD STYLE=\"border: Black 1pt solid; padding-right: 5.4pt; padding-left: 5.4pt\">\n    <P STYLE=\"font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0; text-align: center\">CUSIP NUMBER</P>\n    <P STYLE=\"font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0; text-align: center\">92539Q604</P></TD></TR>\n  </TABLE>\n<P STYLE=\"font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; margin-left: 0; text-align: center\"><FONT STYLE=\"font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt\"><B></B></FONT><FONT STYLE=\"font-size: 10pt\">&nbsp;</FONT></P>\n\n<P STYLE=\"font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; text-align: center\"><FONT STYLE=\"font-size: 18pt\"><B>FORM\n12b-25</B></FONT></P>\n\n<P STYLE=\"font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; text-align: center\"><FONT STYLE=\"font-size: 10pt\">&nbsp;</FONT></P>\n\n<P STYLE=